@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
# Paste a short-lived USER access token locally; do not commit it.
@accessToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@organizationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Database readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Current identity
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create organization; creator becomes Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "My agency" }

### My organizations (stable name/id ordering)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Selected organization
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organizationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Rename (Admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organizationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Renamed agency" }
